/P 237 0 R
/E (As on this NSS GEC Patan Organized an event in which Principal GEC Patan along with Faculties from various departments were present. The event started with prayer song followed by presentation in which Students were motivated with Spiritual and Energetic thoughts of Swami Vivekananda by Vikhnesh Pillai an NSS Volunteer. After that An Essay writing competition along with poster making competition was organized by NSS Family in order to upbring the hidden talents among the youth of India. Also the faculties Of college shared their views on todays youth and tried to motivate all of us.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
