/E (On 21st June International Yoga Day is celebrated all over globe with the good intentions of making people of globe stress free, and fit to protect themselves from all the health related problems and protect them from negativity spread around the world. As a part of these NSS GEC Patan organised a yoga session in college campus for motivating students for performing yoga every day which would help in reducing stress level which is a major issue among students nowadays and making youth of India fit and stress free.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
717 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 243 0 R
/E (One of the student named Dewanshi Gauswami guided everyone with different yoga asanas and explained the importance of each asanas. In this all faculties of college including principal also joined to motivate the youth and show their interest towards fitness . We started at 6:30 and performed different asanas for around 1:30 hour also understanding the importance of each asanas.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [8]
>>
